# Root build context, used only by portal/Dockerfile.release in the release
# workflow. That image COPYs two things — a pre-built binary from bin/ and
# portal/docker-entrypoint.sh — so everything else is dead weight in the context
# upload, and .git alone is tens of megabytes.
#
# portal/.dockerignore governs the build-from-source image, whose context is
# portal/.
.git
.github
deploy
docs
*.md
LICENSE

.env
*.env
!*.env.example
secrets/

node_modules
portal/web-react
portal/internal/web/dist
